        {
          "id": 1919814,
          "username": "Shadab_dev",
          "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/shadab_dev/{size}/372863_2.png",
          "created_at": "2026-10-22T02:08:43.470Z",
          "cooked": "<p>This is a more detailed one. But i have used Back In Stock alert, notify me app. This adds a notify me button on the pdp so users add their email to sign up. Once you restock or add inventory an email automatically gets send.</p>\n<p>I.E. if I add 8 items back to stock then the first 8 customers on the notify list get emails? I cannot confirm of this specific behaviour. You can reach out to chat support. Support is great.</p>",
          "post_number": 2,
          "post_type": 1,
          "posts_count": 3,
          "updated_at": "2026-10-22T02:08:43.470Z",
          "reply_count": 0,
          "reply_to_post_number": null,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "incoming_link_count": 0,
